+---
+id: dl-005-json-merge-patch-copy-on-apply-strict-json-inputs-jsonmergepatcherror
+type: decision-log
+title: "JSON Merge Patch: copy-on-apply, strict JSON inputs, JsonMergePatchError"
+status: pending
